<view class="local-page">
 <view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">猫爪物账 · 本地版</view><view class="title"><text class="hero-piece">把生活，</text><text class="hero-piece">好好收好</text></view><view class="note">免登录，工具免费。物品、账目和照片保存在当前设备，换手机需要完整备份。</view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card error" role="alert">{{error}}<button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="{{local ? 'refresh' : 'refreshMigration'}}">重新读取</button></view>
 <block wx:if="{{!local}}">
 <view class="card"><view class="heading">把云端资料带回本机</view><view class="note">只需三步：下载并核对 → 保存完整备份 → 确认切换。快照、照片下载和校验会自动完成。</view><view class="note">迁移前可继续使用原云端资料；下载期间请暂停编辑，如有变化会要求重新核对。</view><view wx:if="{{account}}" class="reminder">来源账户：{{account.username}} · 编号 {{account.id}}</view><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="startMigration">{{busy ? '正在处理，请稍候…' : migration.phase === 'prepared' || migration.phase === 'confirmed' ? '1. 资料已核对，重新检查' : migration ? '1. 继续下载并核对' : '1. 下载并核对资料'}}</button><view wx:if="{{progress}}" class="reminder" aria-live="polite">{{progress}}</view><view wx:if="{{migration}}" class="note">物品 {{migration.manifest.counts.items}} 件 · 账目 {{migration.manifest.counts.ledger_entries}} 笔 · 照片 {{migration.manifest.photos.length}} 张，包含回收站及历史记录。</view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{migration.phase === 'prepared' || migration.phase === 'confirmed'}}" class="card"><view class="heading">2. 保存完整备份</view><view class="note">点击后自动生成 ZIP 并打开微信文件分享。请发送到文件传输助手或保存到小程序之外，核实文件可用；默认不加密，请妥善保管。</view><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="backupMigration">生成并分享完整备份</button><view wx:if="{{backup}}" class="filename">迁移备份：{{backup.name}}</view><block wx:if="{{migration.previousFolder}}"><view class="reminder">本机已有另一份资料。切换前还需另存一份，避免覆盖后无法找回。</view><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="backupPrevious">另存本机原有资料备份</button><view wx:if="{{previousBackup}}" class="filename">原资料备份：{{previousBackup.name}}</view></block><view class="note">仅生成文件或取消分享不代表已外部保存。</view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{migration.phase === 'prepared' || migration.phase === 'confirmed'}}" class="card"><view class="heading">3. 确认切换</view><view class="note">核实{{migration.previousFolder ? '两份备份都' : '备份已'}}保存在小程序之外后再继续。确认会同时记录外部备份并切换，云端原资料保留。</view><button class="danger" disabled="{{busy || !backup || (migration.previousFolder && !previousBackup)}}" bindtap="confirmMigration">备份已保存，确认切换到本机</button></view>
 <view class="card"><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="toggleMigrationTools">{{migrationTools ? '收起问题处理' : '遇到问题？'}}</button><block wx:if="{{migrationTools}}"><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="refreshMigration">查询迁移状态</button><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="retryCloudConnection">重新连接旧云端账户</button><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="beginMigration">重新创建快照</button><button wx:if="{{migration}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="redownloadMigration">重新下载完整资料</button></block></view>
 </block>
 <block wx:else>
 <view wx:if="{{transition}}" class="card"><view class="heading">以前用过云端版？</view><view class="note">即使已清掉登录缓存，也可主动连接旧账户并迁移资料。本机现有资料不会被直接覆盖。</view><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="enterCloudMigration">找回／迁移旧云端资料</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{info}}" class="card"><view class="heading">本机空间</view><view class="amount">{{info.usedText}}</view><view class="note">微信用户文件目录当前用量。实际可用空间由微信与设备决定。</view><view class="note">上次外部备份：{{info.backupText}}</view><view wx:if="{{info.remind}}" class="reminder">资料有变化，记得保存一份新的完整备份。</view><view wx:if="{{info.cleanupPending}}" class="note">部分临时文件暂未清理，可稍后重试。</view><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="clearExports">清理临时备份包</button><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="clean">清理无引用照片</button></view>
 <view class="card"><view class="heading">完整备份</view><view class="note">ZIP 包含个人物品、账目、历史记录与照片，默认不加密。确认已保存到聊天等外部位置后，本机ZIP自动清理；未确认的临时包最多保留一份。</view><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="exportBackup">1. 生成完整备份</button><block wx:if="{{backup}}"><view class="filename">{{backup.name}}</view><button wx:if="{{!backup.localDeleted}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="shareBackup">2. 分享／保存备份文件</button><view wx:if="{{backup.localDeleted}}" class="note">本机临时ZIP已清理，外部备份记录保留。再次发送请重新生成。</view><view wx:if="{{backup.cleanupPending}}" class="note">临时文件暂未清理，可在上方重试清理。</view><button disabled="{{busy || backup.external}}" bindtap="savedBackup">{{backup.external ? "已记录外部备份" : "3. 确认已保存到外部"}}</button></block></view>
 <view class="card"><view class="heading">从备份恢复</view><view class="note">整库替换，不合并不同设备的资料。请先备份当前资料。</view><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="chooseBackup">选择聊天中的 ZIP 备份</button><block wx:if="{{incoming}}"><view class="note">备份日期：{{incoming.createdAt}}</view><view class="note">照片：{{incoming.photos}} 张</view><view class="filename">{{incoming.countText}}</view><button class="danger" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="restoreBackup">核对后替换全部资料</button></block></view>
 <view wx:if="{{candidates.length}}" class="card"><view class="heading">内部恢复版本</view><button wx:for="{{candidates}}" wx:key="slot" data-index="{{index}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="recover">版本 {{item.generation}} · {{item.time}}</button></view>
 <view class="note footer">卸载微信、删除小程序数据或清理文件可能丢失本机资料。应用内恢复副本不能替代外部备份。</view>
 </block>
</view>
